# gtop: process viewer from holyc/notcoreutils
Size 110x30
Theme dark
Title "gtop"
Setup cc -O2 -o $HOME/gtop /data/dev/github/holyc/notcoreutils/gtop.c -lm
Cd /tmp
Slide "gtop" "a tiny top" 1500ms
Run $HOME/gtop
Sleep 2s
Caption "Live processes" bottom
SendKey Down Down Down
Sleep 1s
SendKey q
Sleep 300ms
